{"at":"2026-02-18T23:46:59.520Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":682,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/microsite-share/","title":"MicroSite &#8211; Share","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMLS User Manual\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>MicroSite &#8211; Share</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 3 minutes\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1057 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10283\" class=\"elementor elementor-10283\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b38108 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3b38108\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-567be21 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"567be21\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>PropertyList.es offers different ways to share your property with direct leads/contacts.</p><p><strong style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">No Website? No Problem!</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3976336 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3976336\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1381\" height=\"884\" src=\"/assets/be9670ee-1aab-476d-ba37-f64d82b3dee5\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-12783\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/be9670ee-1aab-476d-ba37-f64d82b3dee5 1381w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Untitled-design-1-300x192.jpg 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Untitled-design-1-1024x655.jpg 1024w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Untitled-design-1-768x492.jpg 768w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Untitled-design-1-20x13.jpg 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Untitled-design-1-32x20.jpg 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Untitled-design-1-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1381px) 100vw, 1381px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7313307 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7313307\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>PropertyList.es offers each agent a FREE, whitelabel, uniquely branded website link, known as a &#8220;MicroSite,&#8221; to share all or selected properties: <br />https://<span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\">Your-Agency-Name</span>.estate-agency.co<br /><span style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">(estate-agency.co is not conected to any other domain)</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fdec11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3fdec11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"394\" height=\"862\" data-src=\"/assets/404a5587-3e6e-4d6e-858e-96eab3d510ee\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-14985 lazyload\" alt=\"\" data-srcset=\"/assets/404a5587-3e6e-4d6e-858e-96eab3d510ee 394w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-09-223902-137x300.png 137w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-09-223902-9x20.png 9w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-09-223902-15x32.png 15w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-09-223902-5x12.png 5w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 394px) 100vw, 394px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 394px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 394/862;\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c14a21c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c14a21c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">This dedicated MicroSite allows you to:</span></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-12:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:133\"><strong>Effortlessly showcase MLS properties:</strong> Create a stunning online presence for your agency and show as a full website or highlight your selected properties with your own branding for your clients.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:117\"><strong>Simplify lead capture:</strong> A built-in contact form captures leads directly from potential buyers and renters which links automatically to contacts in your account.</li></ul><h3><strong>Smart Lead Management</strong></h3><p>Stay updated with platform notifications and email alerts.</p><ul><li><strong>New Leads:</strong> When someone enquires about a specific property, a new contact is automatically created in your account. The message and the enquired property are linked in the timeline.</li><li><strong>Existing Contacts:</strong> When someone already in your database enquires, their contact timeline is updated with the message, and the enquired property is linked to their profile.</li></ul><p>This eliminates manual data entry and ensures you stay organised while following up with every lead.</p><ul><li>Every link generated is unique and links back to the user who created it, allowing admin and staff to easily track what they have sent and monitor the leads generated from their links. WIth admin access you can oversee this in the &#8220;MicroSite Leads&#8221; Tab.</li></ul><h3><strong>MicroSite Options:</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>Check the box:</strong> Link your selected shared properties to a branded mini-website via your logo in the header.</p></li><li><p><strong>Uncheck the box:</strong> The logo in the header will either link to your agency&#8217;s website (if added) or be disabled.</p></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c839d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0c839d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1052\" height=\"522\" data-src=\"/assets/13ef1b6a-b6ac-4325-98bd-8cf860887033\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-14992 lazyload\" alt=\"\" data-srcset=\"/assets/13ef1b6a-b6ac-4325-98bd-8cf860887033 1052w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2025-01-09-224228-300x149.png 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2025-01-09-224228-1024x508.png 1024w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2025-01-09-224228-768x381.png 768w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2025-01-09-224228-20x10.png 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2025-01-09-224228-32x16.png 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot-2025-01-09-224228-18x9.png 18w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1052px) 100vw, 1052px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1052px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1052/522;\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a89edae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a89edae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:100\"><strong>How to share properties:</strong></h3><p><strong>a.  Select a Property:</strong> Choose the specific property you want to share.</p><p><strong>b.  Click &#8220;SHARE&#8221;:</strong> This will generate a unique link for that property.</p><p><strong>c.  Share Instantly &amp; Save to Contact:</strong> Easily share the link via WhatsApp, social media, email, or any other platform. <br /><strong>Here you can save a note that the link was shared with a specific or new contact in your account.</strong></p><p><strong>Every MicroSite Link comes with a built-in contact form.</strong> When someone clicks on your property and fills out the form, you&#8217;ll receive a &#8220;<a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/direct-microsite-leads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>MICROSITE LEAD</strong></a>&#8221; in your account.</p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-12816 size-full lazyload\" data-src=\"/assets/79ce1125-7edb-4267-bf9a-4a9a10ed2a67\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1080px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1080/720;\" /></p><p>If the contact <strong>is already saved</strong> in your account, their contact history will be updated to reflect when and what you sent, and you&#8217;ll receive an email notification.</p><p>If the contact <strong>is not saved</strong> in your account, the system will automatically create a new contact with the relevant information and message in the timeline, and you will be notified.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:83\"><strong>Streamline your communication and connect with potential clients effortlessly.</strong>&#8220;</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tListing a Property                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tManaging Listings                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"MicroSite &#8211; Share • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}